{
"classname" "game_messagebox"
"origin" "-456 -296 232"
"targetname" "info_alias"
"title" "Aliases"
"message" "which is an info_alias: Reference while On lamp_red, Reference while Off lamp_blue, Use Mode On/Off.\n\nThe left button has Target *which. The * makes the game use the entity the alias points to at that moment, so it toggles the red lamp, or the blue lamp once the alias is switched.\n\nThe right button triggers which by its plain name, without the *, and that switches the alias between its two references. A trigger_changealias can point an alias at any other name.\n\nEach lamp is a light (Initially Dark) and an env_sprite with the same name."
}
